brurepo
fput tbzcmpp
fputc 34
fyk tbzkmet
fysv tbzget
fyk tbzkbp
fysv tbqa
fyk tbzkhp
fysv tbqb
fyk tbzkml
fnum 200
fyk tbzkhlp
fysv tbzhelp
fputc 125
end
note ---- /branches and /tags
